{"id":"48f27dd0a6718192","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-kleene-fixed-point.md","title":"连续算子的ω阶段最小不动点","display":"thm-kleene-fixed-point — 连续算子的ω阶段最小不动点","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-kleene-fixed-point","aliases":["72-thm-kleene-fixed-point"],"display":"thm-kleene-fixed-point — 连续算子的ω阶段最小不动点","depends_on":["[[72-df-scott-continuity]]","[[72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison]]","[[72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §4.2 print759–760/PDF771–772; local Kleene argument","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-kleene-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-kleene-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kleene-fixed-point — 连续算子的ω阶段最小不动点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6b5b4d9209f24056\" href=\"?note=6b5b4d9209f24056\" title=\"72-df-scott-continuity\">72-df-scott-continuity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e85e168ce8db5c81\" href=\"?note=e85e168ce8db5c81\" title=\"72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison\">72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1281b74b358815ce\" href=\"?note=1281b74b358815ce\" title=\"72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization\">72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §4.2 print759–760/PDF771–772; local Kleene argument"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)\">\\(\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:D\\to D\">\\(F:D\\to D\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Scott}_{D,\\preceq}(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{Scott}_{D,\\preceq}(F)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b5b4d9209f24056\" href=\"?note=6b5b4d9209f24056\" title=\"72-df-scott-continuity\">72-df-scott-continuity</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:=J_{F,\\omega}\">\\(J:=J_{F,\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:=J(\\omega)\">\\(u:=J(\\omega)\\)</span>；一般稳定阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_F\">\\(u_F\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1281b74b358815ce\" href=\"?note=1281b74b358815ce\" title=\"72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization\">72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization</a>，使用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\preceq,b,F\">\\(D,\\preceq,b,F\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u=\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}\\{J(n):n\\in\\omega\\}=u_F,\\qquad F(u)=u.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u=\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}\\{J(n):n\\in\\omega\\}=u_F,\\qquad F(u)=u.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall z\\in D\\ (F(z)\\preceq z\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ u\\preceq z).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall z\\in D\\ (F(z)\\preceq z\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ u\\preceq z).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限阶段是非空递增链。连续性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(u)=\\bigsqcup_nF(J(n))=\\bigsqcup_nJ(n+1)=u\">\\(F(u)=\\bigsqcup_nF(J(n))=\\bigsqcup_nJ(n+1)=u\\)</span>；删除链的第零项不改变上确界，因为底在其余各项之下。前不动点比较使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 小于等于任意前不动点，故与一般超限构造得到的唯一最小点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_F\">\\(u_F\\)</span> 相同。只有单调性时，该交换步骤没有依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-scott-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"6b5b4d9209f24056","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-scott-continuity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"e85e168ce8db5c81","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization","status":"resolved","id":"1281b74b358815ce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-scott-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"6b5b4d9209f24056","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)$、$F:D\\to D$，且 $\\operatorname{Scott}_{D,\\preceq}(F)$，见 [[72-df-scott-continuity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization","status":"resolved","id":"1281b74b358815ce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J:=J_{F,\\omega}$、$u:=J(\\omega)$；一般稳定阶段 $u_F$ 取 [[72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization]]，使用同一 $D,\\preceq,b,F$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)","display":false},{"tex":"F:D\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Scott}_{D,\\preceq}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"J:=J_{F,\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"u:=J(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"u_F","display":false},{"tex":"D,\\preceq,b,F","display":false},{"tex":"u=\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}\\{J(n):n\\in\\omega\\}=u_F,\\qquad F(u)=u.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall z\\in D\\ (F(z)\\preceq z\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ u\\preceq z).","display":true},{"tex":"F(u)=\\bigsqcup_nF(J(n))=\\bigsqcup_nJ(n+1)=u","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"u_F","display":false}],"bytes":1735,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-429","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-kleene-fixed-point|thm-kleene-fixed-point — 连续算子的ω阶段最小不动点]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-457","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-kleene-fixed-point]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-463","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-kleene-fixed-point|thm-kleene-fixed-point — 连续算子的ω阶段最小不动点]]"},{"id":"f07e41c114d4b890","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f02662d03d2c1226","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"2026-10-22：迭代函数及最小稳定序数已在本册独立给出形式构造，新增等式由两个最小前不动点的唯一性成立。要求ω步稳定时，应使用 [[72-thm-kleene-fixed-point]] 的连续性条件；仅单调的边界例见 [[72-ex-monotone-omega-stage-not-fixed]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-492","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-kleene-fixed-point]]"}],"outgoing":["6b5b4d9209f24056","e85e168ce8db5c81","1281b74b358815ce"]}